{"units":[{"id":"u_y81kve9j","title":"7. 대한민국, 우리가 살아가는 곳","color":"#3E7C6B","date":"","pages":[{"id":"p_1hy33ns8","cue":"","notes":"1. 우리나라의 위치와 영역<div> 1) 우리 국토의 위치와 특징</div><div>   (1) 수리적으로 나타내기</div><div><br></div><div> <span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">① </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">위도</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">북위 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">33-43</span></div><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">       </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">위도는 기후에 영향을 줌</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">       </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">위도가 높다 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">= </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">적도에서 멀다 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">= </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">기온이 낮다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">/ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">기후가 춥다</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">② </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">경도</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">동경 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">124 - 132</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">      - 경도는 시간에 영향을 줌</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">      - 영국을 기준으로 함. 오른쪽(동)으로 가면 시간이 빠름/ 왼쪽(서)으로 가면 시간이 느림</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">③ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">표준시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">동경 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">135</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">      - 일본과 같은 표준시 사용, 왜? 일제강점기의 영향, 세계 국가들의 편리성 </span></p><div><div>   (2) 지리적으로 나타내기</div><div><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">① </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">유라시아 대륙 동안</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">태평양과 만남</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">    - </span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-fami